flowchart TD
    accTitle: A control handler can resume or finish the region
    accDescr: After Confirm.ask suspends submit, resuming false runs submit's remaining match and returns Lesson declined. Answering Submission cancelled skips that match and completes the handler call.
    A["Confirm.ask<br/>suspends submit"] -. requests .-> B["Control arm"]
    B -->|resume false| C["Run match"]
    C -->|returns| D["Declined"]
    B -->|return text| E["Skip match"]
    E -->|returns| F["Cancelled"]
